{title: Mighty Warriors of Asher}
{subtitle: 1 Chronicles 7:39; 7:40; Joshua 19:24–31}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 76}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [Bb] | [Bb] | [Bb] |
| [Bb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Sons of Ulla stand in the light
[Gm]Arah and Hanniel [Eb]keep the sight
[Gm]Rizia walks where the [Eb]promise leads
[F]Heads of the [Bb]fathers in [Eb]their needs
Chosen men from the tribe of Ash[F]er
Mighty warriors who will never fal[Eb]ter
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Twen-ty-six [Bb]thousand [Eb]for the [Bb]fight
Leaders a[Gm]mong the [Eb]leaders [Bb]bright
Enrolled [Gm]for service in the [F]war
The tribe of [Eb]Asher stands [Bb]once more
Heads of their [Gm]houses, strong [F]and true
The chosen [Eb]men the people [Bb]knew
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Fifth lot came out for the clan
Territory marked as the law ran
[Gm]Helkath and Hali in the land
[Eb]Acshaph stands by their own command
[Bb]Allammelech and Amad too
Mishal sees what the borders [Gm]do
West to Carmel and Shihor Lib[Eb]nath
East to Beth Dagon and the path
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Twen-ty-[Bb]six thou[Eb]sand for the [Bb]fight
Leaders a[Gm]mong the [Eb]leaders [Bb]bright
Enrolled [Gm]for service in the [F]war
The tribe of [Eb]Asher stands [Bb]once more
Heads of their [Gm]houses, strong [F]and true
The chosen [Eb]men the people [Bb]knew
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
Zebulun border and the valley deep
Iphtah El where the people keep
[Gm]Beth Emek and Neiel on the rise
[Eb]Cabul on the left side in the skies
Ebron and Rehob and Hammon town
[F]Kanah near the Greater Sidon [Bb]ground
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Ramah turns to the city strong
Tyre is fortified, the right is wrong
[Gm]Hosah turns to the sea so wide
[Eb]Aczib where the waters glide
[Gm]Ummah and Aphek and [F]Rehob near
[Eb]Twen-ty-two towns without a fear
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
Inheritance of Asher clan by clan
The land is given in the hand
Of [Gm]the chosen men and [F]their fathers' name
Remembered in the holy [Bb]frame
{end_of_verse}
